{
  "id": "poem-91dda3e42271ebda543928a0",
  "title": "调笑・调笑令·心记",
  "author": "晁补之",
  "dynasty": "宋",
  "verses": [
    "心记。",
    "好心事。",
    "玉刻容颜眉刷翠。",
    "杜郎生得真男子。",
    "况是东家妖丽。",
    "眉尖春恨难凭寄。",
    "笑作空中唐字。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "宋词选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/宋词/ci.song.4000.json#record-284",
